{"sections":[{"slug":"图复形","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"图复形"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"“<span lang=\"zh\">图复形</span>”"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"“图复形”"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Plain":"\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">定义</span> $G_{k,l}$ <span lang=\"zh\">为</span> $k$ <span lang=\"zh\">个顶点</span>, $l$ <span lang=\"zh\">条边</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">每个顶点度大于等于</span> $3$, <span lang=\"zh\">无自环的有向图生成的向量空间</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">边界算子</span> $d\\colon G_{k,l} \\to G_{k+1,l+1}$ <span lang=\"zh\">将一个有向图映射到所有在其一个顶点处插入一条边得到的图的和</span>.</p>\n<h3>IHX <span lang=\"zh\">关系</span></h3>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">考虑一个图</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">除一个顶点外均为</span> 3 <span lang=\"zh\">度</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">一个顶点</span> 4 <span lang=\"zh\">度</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">有三种方式插入一条边使得所有顶点变为</span> 3 <span lang=\"zh\">度</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">分别称为</span> I, H, X.</p>\n"}}}]}